    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced Battles: Action-packed combat that keeps you on spinning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse themed stages packed with unique challenges and monsters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of choices of fun weapons, items to customize your playstyle\u2014go big or go home!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from seven characters, each with their own awesome powers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a buddy for double the fun, whether at home or online!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials from monsters or epic boss fights in themed chapters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each battle, Cook Up Special Powers! Whip up a one-time dish to unlock unique abilities for that run!Fuse with your partner and HENSHIN! Merge into a one-of-a-kind combo character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prank with your friends by pooping near them (oof) or sacrifice them for mysterious, powerful weapons!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced Battles: Action-packed combat that keeps you on spinning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse themed stages packed with unique challenges and monsters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of choices of fun weapons, items to customize your playstyle\u2014go big or go home!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from seven characters, each with their own awesome powers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a buddy for double the fun, whether at home or online!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials from monsters or epic boss fights in themed chapters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each battle, Cook Up Special Powers! Whip up a one-time dish to unlock unique abilities for that run!Fuse with your partner and HENSHIN! Merge into a one-of-a-kind combo character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prank with your friends by pooping near them (oof) or sacrifice them for mysterious, powerful weapons!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Henshin MyBro is a rogue-lite game full of nonstop fun! Play solo or with a buddy, scavenge ingredients from monsters and bosses, experiment with weapons, cook dishes for boosts, and HENSHIN to special heroes. Cook, fight, and HENSHIN your way to victory!",
